{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/67edd27190b98be816598c0f03b49b29.avif?t=1774351737\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras_big/67edd27190b98be816598c0f03b49b29.webp?t=1774351737 width=1560 height=496 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Relaxing Idle Creature Collector</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Monster Haven sits cozily at the bottom of your screen, letting you raise your monsters at your own pace.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the caretaker of your own Monster Haven</strong> and raise a variety of monsters to help run things smoothly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Improve monster stats</strong> by feeding them crops and delicious meals. Let them battle or play minigames to earn further rewards such as coins and Monster Essence, with which you can further improve your Haven!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each monster contributes in different ways</strong> based on their elemental type: water types boost crop growth, plant types will harvest crops, insect types pollinate and enhance yield and fire monsters improve cooking speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/544f943cb6f80c7fc1be0b6945a4e07c.avif?t=1774351737\" width=1440 height=290 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build up Your Monster Team</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your Starter</strong> to take on your role as monster caretaker.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/08116686bd2ad630e1f9f0bfa8dc05f7.avif?t=1774351737\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras_big/08116686bd2ad630e1f9f0bfa8dc05f7.webp?t=1774351737 width=1560 height=412 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant many types of crops</strong> and watch them grow while you play with your monsters or focus on other things. Once they're ready you can harvest and feed them to your monsters to improve their stats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook delicious meals for your monsters</strong> by choosing from a wide variety of tasty recipes! These delightful treats will further boost and level-up your monsters, making them more effective in combat and minigames.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/187862c8223d8392940dca0c521be347.poster.avif?t=1774351737\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/187862c8223d8392940dca0c521be347.webm?t=1774351737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/187862c8223d8392940dca0c521be347.mp4?t=1774351737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harness</strong> <strong>Monster Essence</strong> from defeated wild monsters. Use it to expand your team with new monster eggs or to evolve experienced monsters into more powerful forms!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/31886710afe8098a47cf409a4ad8169d.avif?t=1774351737\" width=1560 height=645 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on a Campaign to become the Best Monster Battler</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge the Elemental Gurus</strong> and other tamers in an expansive mini-campaign. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make the most of your monster team</strong> in the challenging 2v2 and 3v3 battles!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/c223840d3c2db1a0b03ade00e7ea53b0.avif?t=1774351737\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras_big/c223840d3c2db1a0b03ade00e7ea53b0.avif?t=1774351737 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put your monsters to the test</strong> in tactical turn-based combat! Make clever use of varied stamina-based moves with tons of status effects. If your monsters are in a tough spot, perhaps their Overdrive ability can make the difference?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/6e1ec6ca09e5a616bcb7e3e9df4d25f3.poster.avif?t=1774351737\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/6e1ec6ca09e5a616bcb7e3e9df4d25f3.webm?t=1774351737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/6e1ec6ca09e5a616bcb7e3e9df4d25f3.mp4?t=1774351737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chill and Customize your Haven</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your Haven with tons of unlockable scenery</strong>. Scenery isn't just for show, every item you place will improve the efficiency of your monsters and your Haven.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter your monsters in various minigames</strong> such as the Monster Race. Each minigame further enhances a specific skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/8f157bb9e8d4f76a2ac77527475c9102.poster.avif?t=1774351737\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/8f157bb9e8d4f76a2ac77527475c9102.webm?t=1774351737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/8f157bb9e8d4f76a2ac77527475c9102.mp4?t=1774351737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy a Living, Breathing World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a seemless day/night cycle and the passing of the 4 seasons</strong>. Each season has its own weather patterns such as rain or snow.\u00a0Be on the lookout for certain wild monsters that only appear at specific seasons or at certain times of the day!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/b430d956324a1559154bfd4f0d3a9dbd.poster.avif?t=1774351737\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/b430d956324a1559154bfd4f0d3a9dbd.webm?t=1774351737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/b430d956324a1559154bfd4f0d3a9dbd.mp4?t=1774351737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https: